MultiKeys audit remediation phase 2 (pico-fido): remove button-only attack surface.
- vendor BACKUP/MSE/UNLOCK/EA commands removed (INVALID_CMD); management INS 0x1C write-config / 0x1E reset removed
- U2F register honours alwaysUv like authenticate; credMgmt 0x41 alias no longer skips permission checks
- largeBlobs offset-0 state reset only after pinUvAuth verification
- init_fido() no longer clears needs_power_cycle (CTAPHID_INIT calls it); cbor_reset() does (upstream db4e0e8)
- user-presence event carries operation/RP ID only while a FIDO operation is in progress (MKAUTH waits)
- credential_verify: silent tag compared in constant time, tag derivation failure is an error
Not done: deriving the silent tag from keydev (plan item 7): it would invalidate every stored resident
record tag and fail PIN-less silent authentication (keydev is PIN wrapped); needs a migration design.

